      "writtenOn": "2020-06-23T19:00:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry I was too terse.  The TCPMv1 stack is storing all active modes (SOP, SOP\u0027, SOP\u0027\u0027) into the same storage.\n\nYou could change this to match the TCPMv2 like this:\n    static struct partner_active_modes \n        partner_amodes[CONFIG_USB_PD_PORT_MAX_COUNT][AMODE_TYPE_COUNT];\n\nThe only other change needed to support this should be at line 398 in pd_get_partner_active_modes() and change the return to:\n    return \u0026partner_amodes[port][type];",
      "parentUuid": "339a2dd5_33e6ba07",
